{
  "id": 8834138177735,
  "title": "Personalized Basketball Hoop Comforter with Name and Number",
  "handle": "personalized-basketball-hoop-comforter-name-number-863d6f6ff1-863d6f6ff1",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring the excitement of the court into your bedroom with this custom sports bedding by Jeminise. This personalized basketball comforter is designed for players and fans alike, offering a cozy and stylish way to showcase your passion for the game. Tailored with your choice of name and number, it makes a thoughtful and unique gift for birthdays, holidays, or any special occasion.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own name and number for a truly unique and personal touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with a whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All-Season Comfort:</strong> Lightweight yet durable construction provides the perfect amount of warmth for year-round use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on low or no heat to maintain fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Options:</strong> Available in multiple bedding set sizes with options to add matching pillowcases or a flat sheet.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Cotton/ Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Basketball Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Basketball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
